#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:147
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Cursor documentation lists the field ``type`` for a local server as "
"required, while its examples omit it. ``anet agents wire`` omits it as "
"well. When the installed version of Cursor reports the entry as invalid, "
"add ``\"type\": \"stdio\"`` to the member; this has not been confirmed in"
" a Cursor client. The fields ``command``, ``args``, ``env`` and "
"``envFile`` and the variables ``${env:NAME}``, ``${userHome}``, "
"``${workspaceFolder}``, ``${workspaceFolderBasename}`` and "
"``${pathSeparator}`` are described in the Cursor documentation."
msgstr ""
"Cursor 文档将本地服务器的字段 ``type`` 列为必填，而其示例省略了该字段。``anet agents wire`` "
"同样省略。所装版本的 Cursor 若报告该条目无效，应在成员中加入 ``\"type\": \"stdio\"``；这一做法尚未在 Cursor"
" 客户端中确认。字段 ``command``、``args``、``env`` 与 ``envFile``，以及变量 "
"``${env:NAME}``、``${userHome}``、``${workspaceFolder}``、``${workspaceFolderBasename}``"
" 与 ``${pathSeparator}``，见 Cursor 文档。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:156
msgid ""
"A project file is shared with everyone who holds the repository. The path"
" of the data directory belongs to one machine, so the project file should"
" not be committed with an ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` value. The command-line agent"
" reads the project file, the global file and the files of parent "
"directories; the command ``agent mcp list`` names the source of each "
"entry."
msgstr ""
"项目文件由所有持有该仓库的人共用。数据目录的路径属于某一台机器，因此项目文件不应带着 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 的取值提交。命令行 "
"Agent 读取项目文件、全局文件和上级目录中的文件；命令 ``agent mcp list`` 会列出每个条目的来源。"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:163
msgid "Several identities"
msgstr "多个身份"

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:165
msgid ""
"A machine can hold several identities (``anet id ls``). ``anet mcp`` "
"connects to the daemon of the identity named by ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` and to "
"no other. To register a particular identity, select it with ``--id``, "
"which is an option of ``anet`` and precedes the subcommand:"
msgstr ""
"一台机器可以持有多个身份（``anet id ls``）。``anet mcp`` 连接由 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 指定的身份的 "
"daemon，不连接其他身份。要注册指定的身份，使用 ``--id`` 选择；它是 ``anet`` 的选项，位于子命令之前："

#: ../../agents/cursor.rst:174
msgid ""
"The entry then holds the data directory of that identity, for example "
"``~/.anet/ids/work``. The member name is ``anet``, so one ``mcp.json`` "
"holds the entry of one identity; a second identity needs a member with "
"another name, written by hand."
msgstr ""
"条目随即写入该身份的数据目录，例如 ``~/.anet/ids/work``。成员名为 ``anet``，因此一个 ``mcp.json`` "
"只保存一个身份的条目；第二个身份需要以另一名称手动写入成员。"

